    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2023.02.001",
      "sequence": 7,
      "source_sequence": 8,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "Reprint of: Generalized Autoregressive Conditional Heteroskedasticity",
      "title_cn": "重印：广义自回归条件异方差性",
      "authors": [
        "Tim Bollerslev"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "A natural generalization of the ARCH (Autoregressive Conditional Heteroskedastic) process introduced in Engle (1982) to allow for past conditional variances in the current conditional variance equation is proposed. Stationarity conditions and autocorrelation structure for this new class of parametric models are derived. Maximum likelihood estimation and testing are also considered. Finally an empirical example relating to the uncertainty of the inflation rate is presented.",
      "abstract_cn": "本文提出了对Engle（1982）引入的ARCH（自回归条件异方差）过程的一种自然推广，允许过去的条件方差进入当前的条件方差方程。推导了这类新参数模型的平稳性条件和自相关结构。同时考虑了极大似然估计和检验。最后，给出了一个关于通货膨胀率不确定性的实证例子。",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jeconom.2023.02.001",
      "source_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-econometrics/vol/234/suppl/C",
      "publication_date": "March 2023",
