    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2023.03.001",
      "sequence": 8,
      "source_sequence": 9,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "Reprint of: Initial conditions and moment restrictions in dynamic panel data models",
      "title_cn": "重印：动态面板数据模型中的初始条件与矩限制",
      "authors": [
        "Richard Blundell",
        "Stephen Bond"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "Estimation of the dynamic error components model is considered using two alternative linear estimators that are designed to improve the properties of the standard first-differenced GMM estimator. Both estimators require restrictions on the initial conditions process. Asymptotic efficiency comparisons and Monte Carlo simulations for the simple AR(1) model demonstrate the dramatic improvement in performance of the proposed estimators compared to the usual first-differenced GMM estimator, and compared to non-linear GMM. The importance of these results is illustrated in an application to the estimation of a labour demand model using company panel data.",
      "abstract_cn": "本文考虑使用两种替代的线性估计量来估计动态误差成分模型，这两种估计量旨在改进标准一阶差分GMM估计量的性质。两种估计量都需要对初始条件过程施加限制。针对简单AR(1)模型的渐近效率比较和蒙特卡洛模拟表明，与通常的一阶差分GMM估计量以及非线性GMM相比，所提出的估计量在性能上有显著改进。这些结果的重要性通过一个使用公司面板数据估计劳动力需求模型的应用得到了说明。",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jeconom.2023.03.001",
      "source_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-econometrics/vol/234/suppl/C",
      "publication_date": "March 2023",
